<title>UK: Sweden sets NZ$100 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets NZ$100 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    28.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.35    PAY DATE    28.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
